# "Target creature you control": Bot2's Ornithopter is refused (the refusal) beside Bot1's own (the positive control). In response to
# Bot2's Lightning Bolt, the Veil gives Bot1's Ornithopter hexproof (CR 702.11b), so the Bolt has no legal target on resolution and
# is countered (CR 608.2b); the Ornithopter keeps its +1/+1 counter, and on turn three the hexproof is gone.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Snakeskin Veil
Ornithopter
Plains x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Ornithopter
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x17

